/-!
# Whole energy ledger for source-generated strong continuation

The exact same-receipt heat/Duhamel energy law is assembled over the actual
nonzero integer-frequency carrier.

For every finite family of nonzero waves, the accumulated nonlinear-minus-
viscous work is exactly the change in Euclidean coefficient mass.  Since
both endpoint coefficient families are generated in the whole spatial
Hilbert carrier, their Euclidean masses are summable.  Consequently the
complete nonzero-wave work is summable and its `tsum` is the exact change
in whole punctured vorticity mass.

No finite cutoff, support cover, tail-silence certificate, convergence
witness, endpoint state, or energy identity is accepted as input.
-/

